    <h1>🛡️ MODULE 8</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity</div>
    <div class="subtitle" style="font-size: 1em; margin-top: 20px;">Duration: 4-6 hours | Week 8</div>
