                <h4>Solution</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Hourly full backups to S3</li>
                    <li>Active-passive replication to secondary datacenter</li>
                    <li>Automated backup verification (checksums)</li>
                    <li>Quarterly failover tests with compliance audits</li>
                </ul>
                <h4>Results</h4>
                <ul>
